<title>LITHUANIA: SOCCER-ICELAND BEAT LITHUANIA 3-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ICELAND BEAT LITHUANIA 3-0 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1996-10-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iceland beat Lithuania 3-0</p>
<p>(halftime 2-0) in a European Under-21 soccer championship group</p>
<p>eight qualifier on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Brynjar Gunnarsson (27th), Thorvjorn Sveinsson (40th, 88th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 400</p>
</text>
